WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:06.140
Three simple moves to strengthen your knee. Strong thigh muscles take pressure off the joint.

00:06.640 --> 00:15.150
One. Thigh squeeze. Sit with your leg straight, tighten your thigh, and press the back of your knee down. Hold for five seconds. Ten times.

00:15.650 --> 00:25.220
Two. Straight-leg raise. Lying down, bend the other knee, then lift your straight leg about a hand's height, and lower it slowly. Ten times each side.

00:25.720 --> 00:34.310
Three. Mini squat. Hold the back of a chair, and bend your knees just a little, keeping them over your toes. Then stand up. Ten times.

00:34.810 --> 00:43.510
Do these twice a day. A mild ache is okay. If you feel sharp pain, or your knee swells, stop, and tell your doctor.
